# Core architecture (TOT-Tracking)

Full reference: `.cursor/ARCHITECTURE.md`, `.cursor/BUSINESS-RULES.md`

**Project:** Workforce Activity Analytics — client-side CSV analysis, no backend, no auth.

## Data flow

```txt
CSV upload → useCsvUpload → ActivityParserService → ActivityAnalysisService(events, scheduleBlocks)
    → ActivityContext.analysis
    → ActivityFilterService → ActivityAnalysisService(filtered, scheduleBlocks)
    → ActivityContext.filteredAnalysis → feature hooks → components
```

- Business logic in `src/modules/WorkforceActivity/services/` and `utils/`
- Timeline merge in `utils/timelineMerge.ts` → `applyScheduleBlocksToTimeline`
- UI components are presentational — no parsing or gap math in components
- State in `ActivityContext` (CSV in-memory; schedule blocks in `localStorage`)
- **Hooks use `filteredAnalysis`**, not raw `analysis`

## Module

Single feature module: `src/modules/WorkforceActivity/`

| Concern | Location |
|---------|----------|
| Screen router | `WorkforceActivity.tsx` |
| Views | `WorkforceActivityUpload/Dashboard/AssociateDetail.tsx` |
| Components | `components/` |
| Hooks | `hooks/` |
| Services | `ActivityParserService`, `ActivityAnalysisService`, `ActivityFilterService`, `ActivityChartService`, `ScheduleBlockStorageService` |
| Models | `models/` |
| Context | `context/ActivityContext.tsx` |

## App entry

```txt
src/pages/index.tsx → WorkforceActivity → AppShell + DashboardFilters + view content
```

Single route `/`. Views: `upload` | `dashboard` | `associate` (client state, not URL).

## Do NOT

- Add API clients or auth unless explicitly requested
- Put business logic in components or `src/pages/index.tsx`
- Use `@/` imports (use `src/`)
- Call services directly from components (use hooks)
- Read raw `analysis` in feature hooks (use `filteredAnalysis`)
